      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac406b399c51.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ac406bceed28.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Dark Beast Ganon Beam&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;This is Dark Beast Ganon Beam, a mod that replaces the regular master sword beams with a ported donor effect from BotW (Dark Beast Ganon's laser), generated with our new PTCL tooling. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;u&gt;This mod contains no vanilla content from either games.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;By no means is the process automatic&lt;/i&gt;, however this was a major step in my future ambitions to port Guardians over to tears.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The beam is made of two separate custom actors, and they're done as custom ELink db entries, so technically this could be applied to many other places, and if you're curious, I encourage you to do so!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The mod is entirely romfs and should work with every game version up to 1.2.1 as long as you install it with TKMM, thanks for playing!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Warm regards,&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;- 5th, and the Bladesaw Team.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
